OL,3,GNEWSASix men deny child abuse and rape
OL,4,Acharges
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix men have denied historical offences
OL,7,Frelating to alleged sexual abuse and
OL,8,Frape of children as part of a grooming
OL,9,Fgang.
OL,11,FNine men aged 54 to 76 were arrested in
OL,12,FJuly as part of Gwent Police's
OL,13,FOperation Oak investigation into
OL,14,Fwomen's reports of being sexually
OL,15,Fabused as children in the 1980s and
OL,16,F1990s.
OL,18,FThe defendants, all British citizens,
OL,19,Fappeared at Cardiff Crown Court on
OL,20,FFriday, where six entered not guilty
OL,21,Fpleas.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
