OL,3,GNEWSASix men deny child abuse and rape
OL,4,Acharges
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll of the men were released on
OL,7,Fconditional bail, and a trial date for
OL,8,FJanuary 2028 was set by Judge Tracey
OL,9,FLloyd-Clarke. It is expected to last up
OL,10,Fto 20 weeks.
